("All five stages on one riff: Scan, Split, Isolate, Decode, Mutate.", "Все пять этапов на одном риффе: Scan, Split, Isolate, Decode, Mutate.", "Las cinco etapas en un riff: Scan, Split, Isolate, Decode, Mutate."),
